{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0190","paragraphs":[{"id":"p19e517ed240b-1","text":"柳暗花明春事深。"},{"id":"pdfd6b14b5d9e-1","text":"小阑红芍药，已抽簪。"},{"id":"pa97aedaf3dc7-1","text":"雨馀风软碎鸣禽。"},{"id":"pcd08bcfa6a76-1","text":"迟迟日，犹带一分阴。"},{"id":"pa06417450a34-1","text":"往事莫沈吟。"},{"id":"p9f7d1db4c7a0-1","text":"身闲时序好，且登临。"},{"id":"p856cb2ef6d87-1","text":"旧游无处不堪寻。"},{"id":"pe1c97120fe82-1","text":"无寻处，惟有少年心。"}]}